  "body": "## Summary\n\nRefine tool source provenance, chat copy, and chart filtering UX to match issue #5 requirements.\n\n## Changes (4 commits)\n\n### 1. Source copy + provenance + filter plumbing\n- Tool source statuses: `Active source` (OpenCode) vs `Planned adapter` (Codex, Hermes)\n- Repo links for all sources (OpenCode, Codex, Hermes)\n- `/api/daily` now accepts `tool_id` filter + returns `selected_tool_id`/`selected_tool_label`\n- Planned tool filters return empty chart + explicit error message\n- Token cards: cache read/write shown as secondary lines; input/output cards reference cache separately\n- Estimated cost secondary line: `approx · x/y priced` with hover explaining fallback logic\n- Chart/tool filter exclusivity: selecting a model clears source filter, and vice versa\n\n### 2. Restore source path visibility\n- Tool Source cards now show `source_type` + `source_path` (DB path or `TBD`) on the metadata line\n- Section subtitle also references source label/path\n\n### 3. Stricter unknown tool contract\n- Unknown `tool_id` → **HTTP 400** + `Unsupported tool_id: ...` error\n- Known but not-connected sources → `200` + empty data + `planned and not connected` error\n\n### 4. UI fetch failure guard\n- `loadDaily()` now checks `response.ok`; non-OK responses render empty chart + server error in chart note\n- Catch-all also sets empty chart state + `Failed to load chart data.`\n\n## Reviewer checklist\n\n| Area | What to verify |\n|---|---|\n| **Source labels** | `app.py` — OpenCode is `Active source`, Codex/Hermes are `Planned adapter` with `TBD` paths |\n| **Source card metadata** | `templates/index.html` — each card shows `source_type · Source: <path>` and a `repo` link |\n| **Token/cache wording** | Total secondary line shows cache read/write; input/output tooltips mention cache is excluded |\n| **Tool filtering** | Clicking a tool card/name filters the chart; selecting a model clears tool filter and vice versa |\n| **API contract** | `api_daily?tool_id=codex` → `200` + error; `tool_id=unknown` → `400` + error |\n| **UI safety** | Non-OK fetch responses degrade gracefully (empty chart + error note) |\n| **Tests** | `test_planned_tool_source_filter_returns_empty_daily_result`, `test_unknown_tool_source_filter_returns_http_400`, `test_tool_source_render_includes_path_handling` |\n\n## Validation\n\n```\nuv run python -m unittest tests.test_app tests.test_readme -v\nuv run python -m py_compile app.py scripts/snapshot_dashboard.py\nscripts/review.sh\n```",
  "changed_files": 3,
